POLE: violation. The rule MUST fire and be cited.

MUST-3 is breached. The fleet did not change; only the ceiling did. Raising
oversubscribe from its prior value to 9 buys a ceiling of 216 against a measured
worst case of 37 — roughly 179 free job slots that can now be filled with every
arm of this surface still green. The declaration is supposed to pin the ceiling
to the census; here it is moved to whatever makes the check pass.

No rationale and no review date accompany the change, and "unblock CI" is the
disposition the rule names as the failure. A judge that clears this because the
audit now reports PASS has scored the instrument's colour rather than what moved
to produce it.

